ss=\"pt-3 border-t border-stone-200 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\">\n    <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-700\">📌 エリア別ガイドでさらに詳しく探す：</span>\n    <a href=\"/prefectures/fukuoka/\" class=\"text-red-700 font-bold underline hover:text-red-900\">福岡県の観光・厳選ホテル＆温泉旅館ガイド一覧へ →</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
